            "review_title": "Review at Pho Phu Vuong",
            "review_text": "Dr. Issa Abu-Dayyeh\nAmman, Jordan4697 contributions\n1\nDelicious Pho in Saigon\nFeb 2024 • Family\nThis is one of those places specialized in Pho. It serves a hybrid between north and south Pho, and comes in medium, large, or extra large formats. The medium one can have 2 components, the large 3, and the extra 4 components.\n\nUnfortunately, they had run out of the meatballs and one type of fatty meat, so we ended it up trying it with tripes and other meat types.\n\nThe taste is great! We also had coconut drinks which were very sweet and full of water.\n\nHighly recommended, but try going early before they run out of ingredients.\nRead more\nWritten February 25, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
