            "review_text": "Mervyn33\nSingapore, Singapore353 contributions\n0\nAnother Good Beef Noodle in HCMC\nFeb 2020 • Friends\nThis time I decided to skid my all time favourite Pho Hung at Nguyen Trai for Pho Phu Vuong located at 120 Nguyen Thai Binh, Quan 1, HCMC. There is another outlet located at 339 Durong Le Van Sy.\n\nThe restaurant was clean and spacious. I had a bowl of mixed meats, tendons and noodle .. the noodle is not the flat type but the thin round noodle .. I ordered another bowl just beef and tendons without the noodle. The soup or broth was delicious slightly sweet. However, in term of the beef selection .. Pho Hung have a better options.\nOverall .. my first choice is still Pho Hung followed by Pho Phu Vuong then third on my list will by Phu Le.\nRead more\nWritten February 26, 2020",
